<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria Smithkline Beecham profit falls.</title>
<headline>Nigeria Smithkline Beecham profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result for Smithkline Beecham Nigeria Plc to end-December 1996. (In million naira unless stated).</p>
<p>				  1996	    1995</p>
<p> Turnover		    2,900	   2,600</p>
<p> Profit before taxation  390.8	   451.5</p>
<p> Taxation		    146.2	   147.7</p>
<p> Profit after tax	  244.6	   369.7</p>
<p> Dividend		    25 kobo per share</p>
<p>NOTE - This is the first full account since the merger of Smithkline Beecham with Sterling Products last year.</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
